  "releaseNotes": "Fixes: Autodiscover (AutodiscoverUrl, GetUserSettings, GetDomainSettings) is answered from Microsoft Graph, also with OAuthCredentials, where the port threw NotImplementedException; Autodiscover for an on-premises mailbox in a hybrid deployment reaches the on-premises Autodiscover; Autodiscover is behind the license check like every other request; the Microsoft Graph token goes only over https to the Graph host; a SyncState whose links lead outside the caller's mailbox is refused with ErrorInvalidSyncStateData. Supported operations, verification against live Exchange Online and known differences: https://sunsetless.com/compatibility",
